WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.129 --> 00:00:11.106
In tutorial 8.8, you'll set your own AI
alerts for the figures you care about.

00:00:12.127 --> 00:00:16.577
First, scroll down AI visibility
to Alert rules: your own alerts,

00:00:16.627 --> 00:00:19.377
on top of the ones each weekly run checks.

00:00:19.427 --> 00:00:21.382
How rules work explains them.

00:00:22.376 --> 00:00:24.964
Click Add a rule, and the rule form opens.

00:00:26.376 --> 00:00:29.166
Choose what to watch,
like Named in answers.

00:00:29.216 --> 00:00:33.807
Then pick Drops, Rises or Either
way, and by at least how many points.

00:00:34.876 --> 00:00:38.426
To watch a competitor instead,
choose a competitor's share of voice,

00:00:38.476 --> 00:00:39.661
and type its site.

00:00:40.855 --> 00:00:45.175
Below, the preview shows how often the
rule would have fired on your past runs,

00:00:45.225 --> 00:00:46.407
before you save it.

00:00:47.905 --> 00:00:53.080
Next, narrow the rule to one assistant,
like ChatGPT here, or to a topic,

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.667
buyer role or market.

00:00:55.662 --> 00:00:58.186
Then leave On ticked,
and click Save the rule.

00:00:59.666 --> 00:01:04.621
Your rules are listed here. After each
weekly run, each rule shows whether it fired,

00:01:04.671 --> 00:01:07.450
and why. Edit or delete a rule here.

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:11.425
So you hear when a figure
you care about really moves,

00:01:11.475 --> 00:01:14.341
and the normal ups and
downs never set one off.

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:20.350
So, open Alert rules, choose what to watch,
preview it, narrow it, and turn it on.

00:01:21.375 --> 00:01:23.825
Now your alerts are set. Next,

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:28.244
add your Bing and Search Console
AI reports in tutorial 8.9.
